<div class="bg-grey-50 dark:bg-primary-40" id="about">
    <div class="container py-16 md:py-20 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="w-full sm:w-3/4 lg:flex-1 text-center lg:text-left">
            <h2 class="font-header font-semibold text-primary dark:text-primary-1000 text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl uppercase">
                Not your average developer</h2>
            <h4 class="font-header font-medium text-black dark:text-primary-400 text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl pt-6">
                Technical and Creative</h4>
            <div class="about-copy mt-6">
                <p class="font-body text-grey-20 dark:text-primary-900 leading-relaxed">
                    For <%= professional_experience_years.humanize %> years, I’ve worked as a <span class="font-black">Software Engineer</span> at industry-leading companies, turning ambitious ideas into dependable systems.
                </p>
                <p class="font-body text-grey-20 dark:text-primary-900 leading-relaxed">
                    At <span class="font-black">Lyft</span>, my team created a Simulation Platform that helps the business handle thousands of rides per minute at its busiest moments. At <span class="font-black">Teespring</span>, I led the team behind the online storefront platform that powers merchandise sales on YouTube. At <span class="font-black">OneLogin</span>, I built an identity provider enabling single sign-on for mobile apps.
                </p>
                <p class="font-body text-grey-20 dark:text-primary-900 leading-relaxed">
                    Engineering is only half of how I think. Film, design, and storytelling sharpen my <span class="font-black">curiosity and inventiveness</span>, bringing a deeply creative perspective to every technical problem I solve.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-toolkit glass-panel w-full sm:w-3/4 lg:w-[45%] p-6 sm:p-8 mt-10 lg:mt-0">
            <h4 class="font-header font-medium text-black dark:text-primary-1000 text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-center lg:text-left">
                My Toolkit</h4>
            <div class="about-toolkit-row my-5">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-center lg:justify-start">
                    <i class="bx bxl-javascript text-5xl text-primary dark:text-primary-500 mr-3 sm:mr-4 shrink-0"></i>
                    <h4 class="about-toolkit-label font-header font-normal text-black dark:text-primary-1000 uppercase whitespace-nowrap">
                        <%= "Frontend / " %>
                        <span class="text-primary dark:text-primary-500 font-black">
                            TypeScript & React
                        </span>
                    </h4>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-toolkit-row my-5">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-center lg:justify-start">
                    <i class="bx bxl-python text-5xl text-primary dark:text-primary-500 mr-3 sm:mr-4 p0 shrink-0"></i>
                    <h4 class="about-toolkit-label font-header font-normal text-black dark:text-primary-1000 uppercase whitespace-nowrap">
                        <%= "Backend / " %>
                        <span class="text-primary dark:text-primary-500 font-black">
                            Ruby & Python
                        </span>
                    </h4>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-toolkit-row my-5">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-center lg:justify-start">
                    <i class="bx bx-mobile text-5xl text-primary dark:text-primary-500 mr-3 sm:mr-4 p0 shrink-0"></i>
                    <h4 class="about-toolkit-label font-header font-normal text-black dark:text-primary-1000 uppercase whitespace-nowrap">
                        <span class="normal-case"><%= "iOS / " %></span>
                        <span class="text-primary dark:text-primary-500 font-black">
                            Swift & SpriteKit
                        </span>
                    </h4>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-toolkit-row my-5">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-center lg:justify-start">
                    <i class="bx bx-camera text-5xl text-primary dark:text-primary-500 mr-3 sm:mr-4 p0 shrink-0"></i>
                    <h4 class="about-toolkit-label font-header font-normal text-black dark:text-primary-1000 uppercase whitespace-nowrap">
                        <%= "Film / " %>
                        <span class="text-primary dark:text-primary-500 font-black">
                            Sony A7siii
                        </span>
                    </h4>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
